b_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various enemies and gimmicks are placed within each floor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If the player character comes into contact with them, they fall (a mistake).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no concept of a game over, but upon making a mistake, you restart from a few floors back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How far back you go is random, and in some cases, you may have to restart from dozens of floors earlier.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If your spirit breaks, that\u2019s the real game over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can save your progress each time you clear an area.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can load your save from the title screen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Streaming</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no restrictions on live streaming, posting gameplay videos, or monetization.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["CAPT.G"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754480/d514319648981332e5d4b6a6805c89f2b30bd51f/header.jpg?t=1759134223","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3754480/1602423644/a7b6bfb88a7b22d92ebc394349e1760813dfeedc/1750382009/dash_av1.mpd?t=1749177337","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3754480/1602423644/a7b6bfb88a7b22d92ebc394349e1760813dfeedc/1750382009/dash_h264.mpd?t=1749177337","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3754480/1602423644/a7b6bfb88a7b22d92ebc394349e1760813d